Z||000007||JohnF||10-17-2001||04:26 PM||||FYI - I am going the same at this moment.  In this area, engine is $600 to $800 for a 3.1 mid-mileage (50 to 75K) w/6 mo warranty + $600 to $700 + miscellaneous parts for installation (by competant mechanics).  Total $1200 to $1500+ for a complete job.<P>Hope this info aids you in your search.||||reg||1
